type: software
title: "ACT: Agentic Context Tool - Web4 Reference Implementation"
abstract: "Complete implementation of Web4's Agentic Context Protocol (ACP) enabling humans to interact with AI agents through Linked Context Tokens. Demonstrates society-centric resource pools, ATP/ADP energy economy, autonomous agent operation with human oversight, and trust-based reputation systems. Bridges human intent and autonomous execution in trust-native computing."
